                                        <h3>When is BTS in India?</h3>
                                        <p>April-June school start (varies by state). Peak purchase March-April. Different from USA / UK September pattern.</p>
                                        <h3>Should I plan BTS globally?</h3>
                                        <p>For international D2C brands: yes — multiple regional peaks require calendar management. Australia January + India April + USA/UK August-September all distinct.</p>
